	~Code written by an assistant does not need to be checked
	~You may use an assistant in the quizzes
	=You are responsible for every reported number and must document the prompts behind non-trivial code
	~Only GitHub Copilot is allowed
	####the syllabus makes the student responsible for all results, requires a prompt log, and keeps quizzes closed-book.
